{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はクリスマスライブの初日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、詳しくは内容言えないので\n8日のライブが終わってから書きますが\nたのしかった！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後、ウインクしようと思ったけど\n両目つむっちゃった( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウインクできなかった！！！と思ったけど\nファンの方からの反応が聞こえて\nニヤニヤしちゃった！(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すき！ライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/07/7654320/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/07/7654320/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/07/7654320/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは、FNSです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サヨナラの意味を披露したあとも\nエンディングまで円卓にかわりばんこに座ってるので、みつけてね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい本を二冊かったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の空き時間で\nちょっとずつ読もうっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/07/7654320/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、真夏さん好きです！リスペクトとはまた違う好きなんです！って話してたら\n横にみさ先輩がいて\n真夏さんとお話し終わったあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん～聞いてたよ～\n真夏のことが好きなんだってね～\nもうし～らない！って\n言われて、\n嫉妬してるみさ先輩が可愛すぎて\nズキュンとやられました( ∗︎°⌓︎°∗︎ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、みんなかわいいみんなすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさんも今日一日\nステージ上でも楽屋でも\nキラキラしてて可愛かった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、ずっとみてたいって思った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪好き！今のまりかさんの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/07/7654320/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/07/7654320/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このトナカイのカップケーキたべた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかったあああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/12/07/7654320/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、またあした！"}],"source":"archive"}